0,0,fx,dDialogue: 1,0:01:26.19,0:01:32.63,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 1,0:01:26.20,0:01:32.64,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,dDialogue: 1,0:01:26.21,0:01:32.65,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.22,0:01:32.66,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,lDialogue: 1,0:01:26.23,0:01:32.67,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,oDialogue: 1,0:01:26.24,0:01:32.68,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,nDialogue: 1,0:01:26.25,0:01:32.69,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,gDialogue: 1,0:01:26.26,0:01:32.70,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.27,0:01:32.71,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 1,0:01:26.28,0:01:32.72,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,gDialogue: 1,0:01:26.29,0:01:32.73,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,oDialogue: 1,0:01:26.30,0:01:32.74,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.31,0:01:32.75,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 1,0:01:26.32,0:01:32.76,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,nDialogue: 1,0:01:26.33,0:01:32.77,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.34,0:01:32.78,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,tDialogue: 1,0:01:26.35,0:01:32.79,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,hDialogue: 1,0:01:26.36,0:01:32.80,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 1,0:01:26.37,0:01:32.81,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.38,0:01:32.82,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,pDialogue: 1,0:01:26.39,0:01:32.83,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 1,0:01:26.40,0:01:32.84,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,sDialogue: 1,0:01:26.41,0:01:32.85,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,tDialogue: 0,0:01:34.24,0:01:37.99,Title,,0,0,0,,Veteran ActorDialogue: 0,0:01:39.07,0:01:42.33,Captions,,0,0,0,,Whole Cake Chateau, RooftopDialogue: 0,0:01:44.16,0:01:47.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Amazing...!Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.46,0:01:49.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Vito, what are you doing?Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.37,0:01:51.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Father, it's amazing!Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.14,0:01:55.67,Main,,0,0,0,,The president of the WEJ and Germa's boss are talking-rero!Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.67,0:02:00.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course, they talk. They both have ears and mouths.Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.05,0:02:04.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Still, what a party-rero!Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.68,0:02:08.19,Main,,0,0,0,,The eldest son and the Minister of Candy - Perospero.Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.19,0:02:11.65,Main,,0,0,0,,The eldest daughter and the Minister of Fruit - Compote.Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.21,0:02:15.07,Main,,0,0,0,,The second son - Sweet Commander Katakuri.Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.07,0:02:18.53,Main,,0,0,0,,The 14th daughter - Sweet Commander Smoothie.Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.53,0:02:21.95,Main,,0,0,0,,The third son - Daifuku and the fourth son - Oven.Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.95,0:02:25.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Countless monsters are gathered here...Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.87,0:02:29.92,Main,,0,0,0,,It was reassuring to have them as allies,Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.35,0:02:36.68,Main,,0,0,0,,so it's crazy to think that they'll be our enemies soon-rero.Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.68,0:02:38.09,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Huh? "Enemies"?Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.09,0:02:41.28,Main,,0,0,0,,If you have time to worry, go check downstairs!Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.28,0:02:44.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, Father. Let's go, Gotti.Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.22,0:02:47.47,Main,,0,0,0,,I heard that the wedding cake will be very fancy.Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.12,0:03:08.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama.Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.94,0:03:13.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Here is Mother Carmel.Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.32,0:03:19.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes... My beloved...Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.30,0:03:21.02,Main,,0,0,0,,...Mother!Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.02,0:03:26.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's always nice to     see her smiling brightly.Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.19,0:03:27.89,Main,,0,0,0,,She's like the sun.Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.63,0:03:36.07,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right. Mother is the light of this world!Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.56,0:03:39.90,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,No one knows who she is though...Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.90,0:03:43.54,Main,,0,0,0,,This is my first Tea Party; so I am not familiar...Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.54,0:03:48.37,Main,,0,0,0,,How are you related to this lady, Big Mom?Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.37,0:03:51.96,Main,,0,0,0,,You should really...Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.96,0:03:54.67,Main,,0,0,0,,...mind your own business!Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.34,0:04:03.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Cheers!Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.81,0:04:07.57,Main,,0,0,0,,How's everything going down there?Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.57,0:04:12.35,Main,,0,0,0,,The cooks finished preparing for the Tea Party, so they're enjoying a banquet.Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.35,0:04:16.02,Main,,0,0,0,,We blocked all passages in the meantime.Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.02,0:04:20.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Good. With that done, nobody will be able to come up here for a while.Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.28,0:04:26.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Now we'll set the Horned Transponder Snails to jam radio signals, and isolate the venue.Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.95,0:04:30.62,Main,,0,0,0,, – Don't forget to set up for you-know-what too.  – Yes, sir.Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.41,0:04:39.70,Main,,0,0,0,,We brought you a present   in honor of your daughter's wedding Charlotte-nen.Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.71,0:04:43.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, a treasure chest!Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.12,0:04:45.37,Main,,0,0,0,,My favorite!Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.37,0:04:47.93,Main,,0,0,0,,I wonder what's inside.Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.93,0:04:51.31,Main,,0,0,0,,I brought you a present too, Linlin.Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.31,0:04:53.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Take one from me too!Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.64,0:04:57.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Mine's something rare from the south.Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.27,0:05:01.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, mine is from the farthest reaches of the north.Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.20,0:05:06.99,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm so grateful!  It's always a pleasure to get so many presents!Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.99,0:05:09.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you!Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.94,0:05:12.16,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy!Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.16,0:05:18.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Speaking of treasure chests, Mamigo, I heard you've obtained a great undersea treasure.Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.33,0:05:19.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh?Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.63,0:05:24.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Word reached you quickly. That's my Morgans!Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.04,0:05:25.38,Main,,0,0,0,,It's true.Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.13,0:05:31.39,Main,,0,0,0,,I now possess the chest that has been an  heirloom for generations of undersea royalty!Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.63,0:05:37.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Neptune actually let it slip from his grasp.Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.49,0:05:45.28,Main,,0,0,0,,The legendary...Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.28,0:05:47.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Tamate Box!Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.71,0:05:52.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh! Look how fancy it is!Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.48,0:05:54.04,Main,,0,0,0,,What's in it?Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.04,0:05:57.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Have you opened it yet, Mamigo?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.00,0:06:01.24,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm saving it for the feast after Pudding's wedding,Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.24,0:06:07.26,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll open all the presents, for everyone to see!Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.10,0:06:13.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Father!Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.35,0:06:15.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, you all done?Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.63,0:06:18.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Everything is ready-rero.Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.14,0:06:20.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay. Good job.Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.23,0:06:22.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Guys, go get changed.Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.69,0:06:23.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.56,0:06:28.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Caesar, bring out the mirror.Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.65,0:06:30.83,Main,,0,0,0,,You jerk! Don't call me that!Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.64,0:06:35.22,Main,,0,0,0,,So this is the entrance to the Tea Party.Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.48,0:06:41.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Enjoy it while you can, scumbags!Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.08,0:06:43.47,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Caesar Clown?Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.47,0:06:45.70,Main,,0,0,0,,You're scum too.Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.70,0:06:48.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Just hide that mirror somewhere already.Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.76,0:06:50.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up! I know what I'm doing!Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.64,0:06:53.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Just do your job.  When Big Mom starts shrieking,Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.26,0:06:58.09,Main,,0,0,0,,you gotta bring that mirror and fly into the hall.Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.23,0:07:02.52,Main,,0,0,0,,That's our only escape route.Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.52,0:07:05.94,Main,,0,0,0,,So be sure not to get any ideas.Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.94,0:07:08.33,Main,,0,0,0,,It's too late for me to betray you!Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.33,0:07:11.57,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,This is bad! Bege and his crew are up to something!Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.85,0:07:21.66,Main,,0,0,0,,I carved it off.Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.66,0:07:25.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Information leaks will bring unexpected crisis.Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.71,0:07:28.63,Main,,0,0,0,,The ceremony starts in 30 minutes.Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.63,0:07:34.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Are Straw Hat and his crew ready? He better not be fooling around again...Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.11,0:07:38.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Check for yourself! They're in your body!Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.37,0:07:49.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, you fools! Why're you sleeping?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.60,0:07:51.32,Main,,0,0,0,,You should be getting ready!Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.90,0:07:53.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Let them sleep.Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.70,0:07:57.32,Main,,0,0,0,,They haven't had time to rest since they arrived.Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.32,0:07:59.66,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll wake them up 10 minutes before.Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.66,0:08:01.49,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't believe this.Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.49,0:08:04.79,Main,,0,0,0,,If they become a burden, I'll abandon them immediately.Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.79,0:08:06.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.69,0:08:11.67,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll get everything ready for them.Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.97,0:08:17.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Those idiots... How ridiculous.Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.82,0:08:18.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Right!Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.14,0:08:22.48,Main,,0,0,0,,You need to go back inside.Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.23,0:08:26.09,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go into the hall.Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.09,0:08:28.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Everyone, prepare yourselves!Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.49,0:08:32.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Once we enter...Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.74,0:08:37.02,Main,,0,0,0,,there's no turning back!Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.54,0:08:42.45,Main,,0,0,0,,I hope you're ready too...Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.84,0:08:46.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Vinsmoke Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.79,0:08:52.80,Captions,,0,0,0,,9th Floor,  Bride and Groom  Changing RoomDialogue: 0,0:08:54.12,0:08:55.50,Main,,0,0,0,,I...Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.50,0:08:58.73,Main,,0,0,0,,I wasn't planning on getting married when I came here so...Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.64,0:09:04.60,Main,,0,0,0,,It's really surreal for me, to see you like this...Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.60,0:09:07.41,Main,,0,0,0,,I feel like I'm dreaming...Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.19,0:09:10.49,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Stay cool, stay cool.Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.49,0:09:12.57,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I won't be fooled again.Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.84,0:09:21.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Is it...Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.19,0:09:26.96,Main,,0,0,0,,...a good dream or a bad dream?Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.82,0:09:30.54,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Oh man, she's so cute!Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.54,0:09:33.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Of... o-o-of course, it's a good dream!Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.77,0:09:36.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Really?! That's a relief!Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.88,0:09:38.72,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Hey, calm down!Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.72,0:09:41.51,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,She's just acting!Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.52,0:09:43.98,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,She's planning to kill you!Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.72,0:09:50.15,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Oh?Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.15,0:09:54.03,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Unless, I really was just dreaming...Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.03,0:09:58.29,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,No, no, no! Don't be fooled! You know the truth!Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.29,0:10:01.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji-san, is there something wrong?Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.06,0:10:04.98,Main,,0,0,0,,What? N-No, no, no, no! It's just...Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.54,0:10:07.57,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right!Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.58,0:10:12.44,Main,,0,0,0,,A-About the wedding kiss... Um...Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.44,0:10:17.10,Main,,0,0,0,,I was thinking that If you're embarrassed... doing it in front of all those people...Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.10,0:10:20.22,Main,,0,0,0,,I-I-I could maybe kiss you  on the forehead instead...Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.21,0:10:25.89,Main,,0,0,0,,It's okay to kiss me on the lips. We're gonna be husband and wife.Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.19,0:10:43.68,Main,,0,0,0,,What was that noise?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.51,0:10:47.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji-sama crashed into the ceiling?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.54,0:10:50.75,Main,,0,0,0,,How did that happen?Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.75,0:10:52.71,Main,,0,0,0,,He's bleeding so much!Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.71,0:10:54.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.21,0:10:56.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji-san!Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.59,0:11:00.80,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with this perverted imp?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.80,0:11:02.82,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to blow him away!Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.47,0:11:43.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Is everything all right?Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.30,0:11:46.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah... it's all going well.Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.22,0:11:51.44,Main,,0,0,0,,That's good. This is a very special day for us.Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.21,0:11:54.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't drop your guard. Lick.Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.69,0:11:57.19,Main,,0,0,0,,I know.Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.24,0:12:03.66,Main,,0,0,0,,It's twelve o'clock! It's twelve o'clock!Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.43,0:12:33.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen! It's time for today's main event!Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.27,0:12:38.23,Main,,0,0,0,,The 35th daughter of Charlotte - Charlotte Pudding-sama and...Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.23,0:12:42.61,Main,,0,0,0,,the third son of Vinsmoke - Vinsmoke Sanji-sama's...Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.61,0:12:44.82,Main,,0,0,0,,royal wedding...Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.82,0:12:47.33,Main,,0,0,0,,starts now!Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.83,0:12:53.12,Main,,0,0,0,,♪ Marriage! ♪Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.12,0:12:55.62,Main,,0,0,0,,♪ – Marriage! ♪ ♪ – Marriage! ♪Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.62,0:12:58.00,Main,,0,0,0,,♪ Marriage! ♪Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.06,0:13:11.81,Main,,0,0,0,,♪ – Marriage! ♪ ♪ – Marriage! ♪Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.44,0:13:15.81,Main,,0,0,0,,That's awesome!Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.69,0:13:21.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Without further ado, here are the bride and groom!Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.16,0:13:33.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Wow!Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.71,0:13:42.88,Main,,0,0,0,,The Emperor of the Sea - Big Mom Pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.88,0:13:47.64,Main,,0,0,0,,And the evil army - Germa 66!Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.34,0:13:53.68,Main,,0,0,0,,This young couple will unite their notorious families!Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.27,0:13:58.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Mariage de Raison!Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.27,0:13:58.20,Note,,0,0,0,,Marriage of ConvenienceDialogue: 0,0:14:01.19,0:14:08.70,Main,,0,0,0,,When these two tie the knot,  it will be the start of a fearsome new era!Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.70,0:14:11.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Give it up for them!Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.66,0:14:15.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Look at that!Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.29,0:14:20.21,Main,,0,0,0,,For this extremely beautiful day!Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.13,0:14:26.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Give it up!Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.81,0:14:34.14,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable!Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.64,0:14:38.02,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,What a great actor!Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.73,0:14:44.23,Narrator,,0,0,0,,The bloody wedding has begun!Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.41,0:14:53.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.46,0:15:04.34,Main,,0,0,0,,The ceremony has begun! Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.34,0:15:07.68,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm still hungry...Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.42,0:15:10.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Wake up!Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.80,0:15:13.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you wanna let Sanji down?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.69,0:15:24.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Is there any way to wake him up?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.77,0:15:28.37,Main,,0,0,0,,He was running around the forest right before he fell asleep so...Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.37,0:15:31.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Food is the only thing that'll wake him up.Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.11,0:15:34.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, do you have any meat?! We don't have time!Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.28,0:15:37.08,Main,,0,0,0,,– Meat? – He's gonna have breakfast now?Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.46,0:16:02.42,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,This is your requiem!Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.42,0:16:06.57,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Just listen to it with that stupid look on your face, Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.83,0:16:22.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Sanji-san!Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.08,0:16:24.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji-san, I'm...Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.66,0:16:27.79,Main,,0,0,0,,so happy!Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.79,0:16:32.26,Main,,0,0,0,,P... P-P-P-P-Pudding-chan...Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.26,0:16:35.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Me... Me too!Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.76,0:16:44.18,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,No! No! Stay rational!Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.18,0:16:47.98,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,If you're not careful, you'll...Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.99,0:16:50.23,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,You'll get killed!Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.15,0:16:53.28,Main,,0,0,0,,♪ Marriage! ♪Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.28,0:16:54.32,Main,,0,0,0,,♪ Marriage! ♪Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.32,0:16:55.28,Main,,0,0,0,,♪ Marriage! ♪Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.28,0:16:56.32,Main,,0,0,0,,♪ Marriage! ♪Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.32,0:17:00.20,Main,,0,0,0,,♪ Marriage! ♪Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.20,0:17:02.87,Main,,0,0,0,,♪ Tough love... ♪Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.87,0:17:04.25,Main,,0,0,0,,♪ I've been there... ♪Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.25,0:17:06.76,Main,,0,0,0,,♪ Bitter love... ♪Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.76,0:17:08.22,Main,,0,0,0,,♪ I've been there... ♪Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.22,0:17:14.01,Main,,0,0,0,,♪ Yet despite it all, when it's true love... ♪Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.01,0:17:18.30,Main,,0,0,0,,♪ I must reach the aisle ♪Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.30,0:17:22.10,Main,,0,0,0,,♪ Even if I were drenched with rain ♪Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.10,0:17:25.85,Main,,0,0,0,,♪ Even if spears rain down on me ♪Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.85,0:17:30.87,Main,,0,0,0,,♪ Never let that hand go! ♪Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.87,0:17:32.78,Main,,0,0,0,,– Head chef!  – Head chef!Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.24,0:17:40.78,Main,,0,0,0,,♪ It's time to unveil the... ♪Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.78,0:17:47.87,Main,,0,0,0,,♪ Wedding cake! ♪Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.76,0:18:45.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Bravo!Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.81,0:18:48.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Beautiful! Brilliant!Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.09,0:18:50.92,Main,,0,0,0,,It's so big and fancy!Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.92,0:18:52.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Looks delicious!Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.86,0:18:55.57,Main,,0,0,0,,What a magnificent wedding cake!Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.57,0:19:00.67,Main,,0,0,0,,You did a wonderful job, Streusen! I have to give you praise!Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.67,0:19:02.62,Main,,0,0,0,,It's more than I deserve!Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.62,0:19:06.95,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to eat it!Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.71,0:19:20.38,Main,,0,0,0,,How lovely! Our Altar is on top of the sweet cake!Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.38,0:19:23.18,Main,,0,0,0,,You're, what's lovely!Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.18,0:19:27.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, stop! Come on, Sanji-san!Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.69,0:19:29.56,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Just drop dead already!Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.56,0:19:34.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Pudding-chan looks so beautiful... It feels like I'm watching my younger self.Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.34,0:19:36.74,Main,,0,0,0,,How many decades ago-nen?Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.74,0:19:38.33,Main,,0,0,0,,You must have a death wish.Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.32,0:19:40.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Ouch-nen!Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.25,0:19:48.79,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Enjoy it while you can, my guests.Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.79,0:19:52.92,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,The climax is approaching...Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.86,0:20:08.72,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,It'll all be over before you know it...Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.72,0:20:12.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Please. Enjoy the ceremony from these VIP seats.Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.20,0:20:18.40,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,It's about to start!Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.40,0:20:20.28,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,The bloodbath!Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.04,0:20:23.95,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,At the moment of the wedding kiss...Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.95,0:20:26.87,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,The bloody banquet will begin...Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.87,0:20:32.11,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! But you Vinsmokes are in my way!Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.31,0:20:38.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji's lucky!Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.06,0:20:41.74,Main,,0,0,0,,If I'd known she was that pretty, I wouldn't have minded marrying her.Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.74,0:20:44.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Marrying Big Mom's daughter? Idiot.Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.65,0:20:48.04,Main,,0,0,0,,He's a sacrifice. Don't forget.Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.04,0:20:51.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Once he's married, he'll be under Big Mom's control forever.Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.86,0:20:55.06,Main,,0,0,0,,You're right. It wouldn't be worth it.Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.08,0:21:01.08,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I see... We're surrounded by the Charlotte siblings.Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.67,0:21:04.36,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,We have nowhere to run.Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.36,0:21:08.33,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,And we're unarmed, so we're basically sitting ducks.Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.92,0:21:10.34,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,That's how it should be...Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.43,0:21:14.38,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Germa is a kingdom that shouldn't exist.Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.10,0:21:16.29,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,But...Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.84,0:21:17.72,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Sanji...Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.17,0:21:24.42,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I want you to get away.Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.19,0:21:28.19,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,You have a plan, right? Can I trust you?Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.18,0:21:30.22,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Luffy-kun!Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.22,0:21:34.06,Main,,0,0,0,,In sickness and in health,Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.06,0:21:37.30,Main,,0,0,0,,for richer for poorer,Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.30,0:21:38.98,Main,,0,0,0,,to have and to hold,Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.98,0:21:42.73,Main,,0,0,0,,till death do us part...Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.32,0:21:47.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, guys! We don't have time!Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.30,0:21:49.74,Main,,0,0,0,,You don't get to tell us that!Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.64,0:21:54.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you pledge yourself to love and to be loyal to each other?Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.38,0:22:03.84,Main,,0,0,0,,My wish is finally coming true!Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.10,0:22:20.69,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Pudding? Why are you going to collapse?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.69,0:22:24.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, you may lift the veil and kiss the bride.Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.90,0:22:26.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong, brother?Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.71,0:22:30.53,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,You saw the future, Katakuri!Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.16,0:22:38.33,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll lift your veil.Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.82,0:22:40.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay.Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.80,0:23:26.34,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Take a good look, Sanji...Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.34,0:23:28.38,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,At...Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.36,0:23:31.66,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,At my creepy...Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.66,0:23:33.88,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,third eye!Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.61,0:23:45.96,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Good boy.Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.05,0:23:48.78,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Stay like that...Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.04,0:23:55.12,Main,,0,0,0,,What a beautiful eye!Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.81,0:24:23.23,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.31,0:24:30.69,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! When I saw it up close, I couldn't help it...Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.87,0:24:33.15,Main,,0,0,0,,What is she doing?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.70,0:24:35.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't hesitate, Pudding!Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.46,0:24:38.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Pudding... chan?Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.04,0:24:43.50,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,What is he saying?Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.50,0:24:49.30,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Everyone will be watching the groom, Sanji...Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.30,0:24:54.18,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,...when he sees your third eye, for the first time!Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.98,0:25:01.77,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,In that moment, he'll see his beautiful bride's creepy face...Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.77,0:25:03.73,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,and he'll be distracted for a moment!Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.12,0:25:18.24,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Screw him!Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.12,0:25:21.16,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,What is he thinking?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.79,0:25:26.98,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Ever since I was born, I've never been told...!Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.98,0:25:32.46,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Not a single person has ever told me  that this eye is beautiful!Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.46,0:25:35.76,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Pudding?! Just shoot him!Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.73,0:25:40.40,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,No one's ever...Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.75,0:25:48.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Even if you're my daughter, I can't deny that's creepy... Grow out your bangs, Pudding.Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.34,0:25:54.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes... I understand, ma'am...Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.53,0:25:57.49,Main,,0,0,0,,She's a monster!Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.34,0:26:00.63,Main,,0,0,0,,So creepy!Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.63,0:26:02.33,Main,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with this kid?!Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.04,0:26:06.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Look! She's a freak!Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.35,0:26:10.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't do it!Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.63,0:26:18.72,Main,,0,0,0,,How's that, freak?!Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.72,0:26:20.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Freak! Freak!Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.35,0:26:30.56,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna let you make fun of me!Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.56,0:26:33.96,Main,,0,0,0,,You stupid trash...Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.96,0:26:35.86,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll wipe you all out!Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.86,0:26:38.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Run!Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.53,0:26:49.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Pudding-chan...Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.35,0:26:52.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Screw you!Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.38,0:26:56.98,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kill you!Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.98,0:27:00.51,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm an ugly freak!Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.59,0:27:04.65,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Hey, did you forget the plan, Pudding?!Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.57,0:27:07.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Pudding-chan, are you okay?Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.52,0:27:11.73,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,You do it, Priest!Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.90,0:27:18.95,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,That's no good! He'll miss!Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.38,0:27:34.71,Main,,0,0,0,,He dodged!Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.05,0:27:41.18,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat! Now's the time!Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.18,0:27:43.68,Main,,0,0,0,,That's the gunshot, Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.68,0:27:45.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Great! We'll make it!Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.89,0:27:49.93,Main,,0,0,0,,What was that gunshot?!Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.93,0:27:51.43,Main,,0,0,0,,The priest fired!Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.43,0:27:52.93,Main,,0,0,0,,No, he got shot!Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.93,0:27:53.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Why?!Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.73,0:27:55.48,Main,,0,0,0,,What's going on?!Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.48,0:27:56.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Is this – ?!Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.15,0:28:03.05,Main,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on?! Katakuri, what happened to Pudding?!Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.05,0:28:07.29,Main,,0,0,0,,We have a bigger problem! It's an unanticipated situation, Mama!Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.29,0:28:09.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Not even I can do anything!Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.58,0:28:12.58,Main,,0,0,0,,What should we do?! Sanji hasn't been shot!Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.58,0:28:14.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Is the plan still on?Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.83,0:28:17.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's go!Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.63,0:28:22.51,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Mama! I had no choice but to do what they told me to!Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.51,0:28:25.39,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll take Sanji back!Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.24,0:28:31.52,Main,,0,0,0,,What the – ?!Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.22,0:28:33.60,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I can't stop them!Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.62,0:28:37.40,Main,,0,0,0,,They'll come out of there!Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.40,0:28:38.65,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.59,0:29:00.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Mom!Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.73,0:29:27.37,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.37,0:29:32.33,Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing:  Feeso, Galaxy 9000  Timing: Lance  Quality Assurance: Feeso, Galaxy 9000, Grug, Pepperjack  Soundtracking:  Halee  Infoboxes & Title:  Datenshi  Karaoke: KaitouYahiko  Translation: Crunchyroll